@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title LSP document lifecycle

[*] --> NotTracked : no filename, disabled,\nor unsupported language
[*] --> Closed : supported tab loaded\nwith lsp_doc_open = 0

NotTracked --> NotTracked : edits, saves, closes\nreturn without protocol traffic
NotTracked --> Closed : file becomes supported\nor LSP enabled

Closed --> Open : ensure tracked\ndidOpen(version=max(1, stored))
Closed --> Closed : server unavailable\nor didOpen send fails

state "Open document" as Open {
  [*] --> Clean
  Clean --> Dirty : edit\ndidChange(version + 1)
  Dirty --> Dirty : edit\ndidChange(version + 1)
  Dirty --> Clean : save\ndidSave
  Clean --> Clean : definition, symbols,\ncompletion, diagnostics
}

Open --> Closed : tab close/reset\ndidClose, clear diagnostics,\nversion = 0
Closed --> [*] : editor shutdown
NotTracked --> [*] : editor shutdown

@enduml
